# Expo CNG / Prebuild — Android native project is regenerated on every
# EAS Build via `expo prebuild`, driven by app.config.js + the @rnmapbox/maps
# Expo config plugin. If this folder is uploaded, EAS skips prebuild and the
# Mapbox Maven repo is never injected into android/build.gradle (build fails
# with "Could not find com.mapbox.maps:android-ndk27").
# iOS stays committed — see commit 7eba8d2.
/android/
